Subject: [PATCH 1/3] build: use upstream go.mau.fi/whatsmeow at neonize's pin

neonize builds meowcaller against the same whatsmeow as the rest of the
DLL (v0.0.0-20260921121126-35ae40906e74), so the go.mod and go.sum here
follow it and the dependencies it brings.
